- **VPS**: root@187.127.169.217 | App: `/u01/apps/Metapharsic_ERP` | Port: 5000 → nginx → `erp.metapharsic.cloud`
- **Master Bypass**: `admin` / `Admin@1234`
- **DB**: `erp_user` / `Erp@Metapharsic2026` / `metapharsic_erp` at `127.0.0.1:5432`
- **pg module**: `/u01/apps/Metapharsic_ERP/server/node_modules/pg` (required for standalone scripts)
- **Sync**: `git pull` on VPS → `pm2 restart metapharsic-erp --update-env` (backend) → `npm run build` + restart (frontend changes)
- **Logs**: `pm2 logs metapharsic-erp --lines 50`
- **HTTPS**: Server enforces HTTP→HTTPS redirect globally via `httpsRedirect` middleware. Always test via `https://erp.metapharsic.cloud/api/...`
- **PM2 Cluster**: `metapharsic-erp` runs 2 workers (IDs 14 & 15). Both must be `online` after restart.
- **Frontend Build**: `cd /u01/apps/Metapharsic_ERP && npm run build` (Vite, ~6s, ~2.5MB bundle). Required for any `.tsx` change.
- **File Upload Scripts**: Write to local file → `pscp` upload to `/tmp/` → `plink node /tmp/script.js` with correct CWD for module resolution.

